<title>USA: J. Baker Inc Nov same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>J. Baker Inc Nov same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995    Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$86	$87	-0.8	 +4.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $736     $836     -11.9	 +1.4</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	 Nov. 30.</p>
<p>Year-to-date sales drop is primarily the result of closing 357 Fayva shoe stores in fiscal 1996. Fayva division sales accounted for $106 million in the comparative year-ago period.</p>
</text>
